    "created_at": "2017-09-03T09:00:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-03T09:00:00Z",
    "body": "I think that makes sense given that nobody uses it for anything else and just like script has event handlers that are tightly coupled with JavaScript, style has `style=\"\"`. If we ever did get another language for stylesheets we'd probably figure out exactly what kind of model changes we'd need at that point.",
