    "updated_at": "2017-09-03T23:38:48Z",
    "body": "Yup, I agree with @annevk. Just make it CSS-specific for now; if we ever grow a second styling language, *then* we'll know what we need to do to accommodate it, and can make the necessary changes. Until that day, we've only got one language and no plans to add additional ones, no reason to be unnecessarily generic.",
